## The DOM renderer's host trait: what the JavaScript provider in
## `providers/dom.mjs` implements. The commands and events it carries are
## `ui`'s protocol.
use dep.ui.{Command, UiEvent}

## What a host must provide. `apply!` consumes one batch of commands and
## `next_event!` waits for the next user event; a handler of 0 ends the
## event loop.
@host
pub trait Surface:
    fn apply!(&mut self, commands: List[Command]) -> void
    fn next_event!(&mut self) -> UiEvent
